== a fresh machine, armed: the key was missing, so it gets exactly the list ==
  availableModels: ["opus", "sonnet", "haiku"]
  PreToolUse       model-guard x1 ['*'] · 0 other entries
  SessionStart     model-guard x1 ['-'] · 1 other entry
  PreModelSwitch   model-guard x1 ['-'] · 0 other entries
  PostModelSwitch  model-guard x1 ['-'] · 0 other entries
  PostToolUse      model-guard x1 ['Agent'] · 0 other entries
== a human's settings: Fable leaves their list, everything else of theirs stays ==
  availableModels: ["opus", "sonnet"]
  PreToolUse       model-guard x1 ['*'] · 1 other entry
  SessionStart     model-guard x1 ['-'] · 1 other entry
  PreModelSwitch   model-guard x1 ['-'] · 0 other entries
  PostModelSwitch  model-guard x1 ['-'] · 0 other entries
  PostToolUse      model-guard x1 ['Agent'] · 1 other entry
